title "17 — SITL Test Environment Topology\nSoftware-In-The-Loop Network and Process Layout  ·  MC-TP-001 §3.2\n<color:#C02020>Design target — actual TEST-002 harness is single-drone, native processes, no Docker (see note)</color>"

